, typically worn by army commanders and leaders."},"defenceVal":"8","hp":"550","price":"8200","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1023005","name":{"zh":"铁胄","en":"Iron Helm"},"level":"0","description":{"zh":"最简易的头盔，在士兵与伍长之间最为常见。","en":"The simplest helmet, most common among soldiers and squad leaders."},"defenceVal":"2","price":"800","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}}],"family":{"father":{"label":{"zh":"父亲","en":"Father"},"people":[{"id":"WJ1047915","code":"0"}]},"children":{"label":{"zh":"子女","en":"Children"},"people":[{"id":"WJ1048315","code":"100"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI113115","name":{"zh":"白马氐杨氏","en":"The Yang Clan of the Baima Di"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自氐族，白马氐部。东汉建安年间，氐族首领杨腾（一说杨驹）率部迁居仇池山。其孙杨千万时自称百顷王。三国时期陇南氐族最大势力，曹魏与蜀汉争相拉拢的对象。杨千万先附马超抗曹，后败投蜀汉，其部众被曹操迁至扶风、天水一带。杨氏后裔于西晋末年在陇西建立仇池国，历五胡十六国至南北朝，是氐族政权中延续时间最长的家族。","en":"Originating from the Di people, of the Baima Di branch. During the Jian'an era of the Eastern Han dynasty, the Di chieftain Yang Teng (also said to be Yang Ju) led his tribe to relocate to Mount Qiuchi. By the time of his grandson Yang Qianwan, he claimed the title King of Baiqing. They were the greatest Di Faction in Longnan during the Three Kingdoms period, courted by both Cao Wei and Shu Han. Yang Qianwan initially joined Ma Chao to oppose Cao Cao, but after his defeat, he fled to Shu Han, while his tribesmen were relocated by Cao Cao to the Fufeng and Tianshui regions. In the late Western Jin, descendants of the Yang clan established the state of Qiuchi in Longxi, enduring through the Sixteen Kingdoms to the Northern and Southern Dynasties, making them the longest-surviving Family among Di regimes."},"talent":{"military":"7","commerce":"6","politics":"8"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":{"name":"杨腾驹","height":"较矮","shape":"精壮"},"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yello