n":"150","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15004","armor":"WP1000505","helmet":"WP1023005"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"白马氐族部落大帅，趁汉末大乱率部迁徙至仇池山，凭借天险建立基业。有勇有谋，在曹操、马超等群雄之间周旋，为延续近三百年的仇池杨氏政权奠基。","tc":"白馬氐族部落大帥，趁漢末大亂率部遷徙至仇池山，憑借天險建立基業。有勇有謀，在曹操、馬超等群雄之間周旋，為延續近三百年的仇池楊氏政權奠基。","en":"High chieftain of the Baima Di tribe. Taking advantage of the chaos at the end of the Han dynasty, he led his followers to migrate to Mount Chouchi, establishing his domain upon its natural defenses. Possessing both bravery and resourcefulness, he maneuvered among rival warlords such as Cao Cao and Ma Chao, laying the foundation for the Chouchi Yang regime that would endure for nearly three hundred years.","jp":"白馬氐の部族大帥。後漢末の動乱に乗じて部衆を率いて仇池山へと移住し、天険を頼りに基業を築いた。勇謀を兼ね備え、曹操や馬超ら群雄の間を立ち回り、300年近く続く仇池楊氏政権の礎を築いた。","kr":"백마저족 부족의 대수로, 후한 말의 혼란을 틈타 무리를 이끌고 구지산으로 이주하여 천험의 요새를 발판 삼아 기반을 다졌습니다. 용기와 지략을 겸비하여 조조, 마초 등 군웅들 사이에서 능란하게 처신하며, 약 300년간 이어진 구지 양씨 정권의 기틀을 마련했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1048015","remark":"普武","surname":"杨","surnameTc":"楊","surnameEn":"Yang","surnameJp":"楊","surnameKr":"양","surnameOther":"","name":"腾驹","nameTc":"騰駒","nameEn":"Tengju","nameJp":"騰駒","nameKr":"등구","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"杨腾驹","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1035","gender":"0","rule":"58","force":"56","wise":"68","politics":"60","charm":"60","will":"68","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"4","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"56/32/26/30/26/25/34/33","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4400","battleSoulPoint":"6500","